  [codex stderr] +# DevG Two-Eyes System Review Findings
  [codex stderr] +
  [codex stderr] +Date: 2026-03-10
  [codex stderr] +Scope: clean-room Section 1 findings from current repo state and observed test/artifact evidence
  [codex stderr] +Repo: `/Volumes/claude-projects/projects/devotional-generator-system-a`
  [codex stderr] +
  [codex stderr] +## Executive Finding
  [codex stderr] +
  [codex stderr] +DevG is not yet competition-ready for execution because the current repo does not prove a complete review-to-publish path on competition-format outputs. The primary blocker is not generation quality; it is state-transition completeness between review artifacts and publish-ready export.
  [codex stderr] +
  [codex stderr] +## Severity-Ranked Findings
  [codex stderr] +
  [codex stderr] +### SEV-1: Publish-ready path is blocked by queue/export mismatch and missing finalization path
  [codex stderr] +
  [codex stderr] +Status: Open
  [codex stderr] +
  [codex stderr] +Verified evidence:
  [codex stderr] +
  [codex stderr] +- `src/api/full_run_assets.py` builds review queues with `include_agent_validated=False` by default
  [codex stderr] +- same file excludes `verification_status == "agent_validated"` sections from `pending_sections`
  [codex stderr] +- `src/api/export_gate.py` still requires `approval_status == APPROVED` for all present sections
  [codex stderr] +- sampled latest run `2026-03-09__195419__genesis-1-&-2__12-day__vol-2` shows:
  [codex stderr] +  - `pending_section_count = 61`
  [codex stderr] +  - `blocked_reason` begins with `72 section(s) pending approval`
  [codex stderr] +- sampled `__book.json` contains `11` sections with:
  [codex stderr] +  - `approval_status = pending`
  [codex stderr] +  - `verification_status = agent_validated`
  [codex stderr] +- repo search found no script that applies `__approval-decisions.json` back into the book and exports a publish-ready PDF
  [codex stderr] +
  [codex stderr] +Why this matters:
  [codex stderr] +
  [codex stderr] +- Operators can finish the visible review queue and still remain blocked from publish-ready export.
  [codex stderr] +- The repo currently proves generation and review bundle creation, but not the state transition from reviewed content to publish-ready output.
  [codex stderr] +- Section 3 cannot be certified until this path exists and is exercised.
  [codex stderr] +
  [codex stderr] +Required fix direction:
  [codex stderr] +
  [codex stderr] +- Align review queue semantics with export gate semantics, or add an explicit, tested state promotion path for agent-validated sections that still preserves fail-closed behavior.
  [codex stderr] +- Add a deterministic decision-application and publish-ready export command path.
  [codex stderr] +
  [codex stderr] +### SEV-2: PDF heading normalization regression leaks internal section keys
  [codex stderr] +
  [codex stderr] +Status: Open
  [codex stderr] +
  [codex stderr] +Verified evidence:
  [codex stderr] +
  [codex stderr] +- `ui/pdf/__tests__/blocks.test.ts` fails:
