  [codex stderr] +### SEV-1: Publish-ready path is blocked by queue/export mismatch and missing finalization path
  [codex stderr] +
  [codex stderr] +Status: Open
  [codex stderr] +
  [codex stderr] +Verified evidence:
  [codex stderr] +
  [codex stderr] +- `src/api/full_run_assets.py` builds review queues with `include_agent_validated=False` by default
  [codex stderr] +- same file excludes `verification_status == "agent_validated"` sections from `pending_sections`
  [codex stderr] +- `src/api/export_gate.py` still requires `approval_status == APPROVED` for all present sections
  [codex stderr] +- sampled latest run `2026-03-09__195419__genesis-1-&-2__12-day__vol-2` shows:
  [codex stderr] +  - `pending_section_count = 61`
