  [codex stderr] +
  [codex stderr] +Why this matters:
  [codex stderr] +
  [codex stderr] +- Reader-facing PDF output can expose implementation identifiers instead of devotional labels.
  [codex stderr] +- This directly affects the preview/export presentation surface.
  [codex stderr] +
  [codex stderr] +Required fix direction:
  [codex stderr] +
