  [codex stderr] +- `src/api/export_gate.py` still requires `approval_status == APPROVED` for all present sections
  [codex stderr] +- sampled latest run `2026-03-09__195419__genesis-1-&-2__12-day__vol-2` shows:
  [codex stderr] +  - `pending_section_count = 61`
